    "description": "Dave\u2019s Hot Chicken\u00ae app provides a convenient way to order & earn or redeem Dave\u2019s Frequent Fryer Points. You eat and you earn.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n+ Find stores near you, get directions/hours, and view store amenities.\r\n+ A personalized menu - made just for you! With the Dave\u2019s Hot Chicken\u00ae app you can easily re-order your favorites & recent orders.\r\n+ Customize & place your order using the app then pick up from a nearby participating store without waiting in line.\r\n+ Earn & Redeem Dave\u2019s Frequent Fryer Points! Whether you order Dave\u2019s online, in-app, or in-store, our app records all your points. You get 10 Dave\u2019s Frequent Fryer Points for every dollar you spend*. Watch how fast those points add up!\r\n+ Get your order delivered right to your door (at participating locations.)\r\n+ Unlock app-only offers & early access to new items + collabs.\r\n\r\n*At participating stores. Restrictions apply. See daveshotchicken.com for details.\r\n\r\nABOUT DAVE'S HOT CHICKEN\u00ae \u2022 THE REAL STORY\r\nDave\u2019s Hot Chicken was created by best friends Dave Kopushyan, Arman Oganesyan, and Tommy and Gary Rubenyan. Dave, a chef trained in Thomas Keller\u2019s (French Laundry) organization set out to create the perfect Hot Chicken by searching, tasting, and frying. The four friends scrounged up $900 to put a tiny stand in an East Hollywood parking lot. The menu was simple, and the chicken was the star. Sourced and prepared to be the juiciest and most tender chicken imaginable, each piece is topped with Dave\u2019s signature mix of spices ranging from No Spice to \u201cThe Reaper.\u201d",
